# Pflegedienst Invoicer - Run Instructions

## 1. Start MongoDB (Docker)
```bash
cd ~/Documents/Invoicer/pflegedienst_invoicer
docker-compose up -d mongodb mongo-express
```

## 2. Activate Python environment
```bash
cd ~/Documents/Invoicer/pflegedienst_invoicer
source .venv/bin/activate
```

## 3. Start FastAPI backend
```bash
uvicorn backend:app --reload --host 127.0.0.1 --port 8000
```

## Quick Start (all-in-one)
```bash
cd ~/Documents/Invoicer/pflegedienst_invoicer
docker-compose up -d mongodb mongo-express && source .venv/bin/activate && uvicorn backend:app --reload --host 127.0.0.1 --port 8000
```

## If port 8000 is already in use
```bash
docker stop pflegedienst_backend
```

## Stop Services
```bash
# Stop backend: Ctrl+C
# Stop MongoDB:
docker-compose down
```

## Check MongoDB status
```bash
docker ps  # Should show pflegedienst-mongo running
```